# Sherubtse College — /cms access control
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# This folder is the Strapi CMS/backend. It runs its own Node server on
# port 1337 (started separately with `npm run develop` / `npm start`
# from inside this folder) — it is NOT meant to be served by Apache at
# all. This blocks Apache from ever handing out any file in here
# directly (source code, .env, the SQLite database, node_modules, etc.)
# if someone requests /cms/... over HTTP.

Require all denied
Options -Indexes
